7.29 night $SNDK  analysis
In the early stage, it formed a complete bullish rising swing by holding around the 1050 USD low. During the upswing, the bullish candles had full-bodied bodies, and incremental capital continued to flow in, pushing the price higher;
After the price reached the $1125 swing high, the market trend fully reversed. It formed a standard bearish downtrend structure, with the highs gradually moving down and the lows moving down in sync. Multiple consecutive large-bodied bearish candles expanded volume as they fell, showing strong bearish momentum;
At present, the latest K-line is only a single extremely narrow, slightly corrective bullish candle. The rebound strength is extremely weak and is merely a short-term technical counter-rebound after a major selloff; it cannot change the overall bearish downtrend structure. One Fan’s personal suggestion: around 1150-1268, target 1050-980#BTC #ETH #BTC走势分析
